    {
      "subId": "7007408",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Varka",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700740801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700740801": {
            "id": "700740801",
            "speakerId": 15161,
            "speakerName": "Pigeon",
            "text": "Coo...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740802"
            ]
          },
          "700740802": {
            "id": "700740802",
            "speakerId": 1310,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Got 'em! The feathers are in the bag — I repeat, the feathers are in the bag.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740803"
            ]
          },
          "700740803": {
            "id": "700740803",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Finally! This task really is harder than Paimon thought...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740804"
            ]
          },
          "700740804": {
            "id": "700740804",
            "speakerId": 1310,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Just one more ingredient to go... \"Medicinal broth brewed in a large cauldron.\" That's gotta be Dadaupa Gorge.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740805"
            ]
          },
          "700740805": {
            "id": "700740805",
            "speakerId": 1310,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "I'll head over there right away. Follow whenever you can, alright?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740806"
            ]
          },
          "700740806": {
            "id": "700740806",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey, wait a—! Geez, talk about excited... That guy just took off faster than a flock of flustered pigeons...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740809"
            ]
          },
          "700740809": {
            "id": "700740809",
            "speakerId": 502,
            "speakerName": "Diona",
            "text": "...That old boozehound!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740810"
            ]
          },
          "700740810": {
            "id": "700740810",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Hmm? Who's there?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740811"
            ]
          },
          "700740811": {
            "id": "700740811",
            "speakerId": 502,
            "speakerName": "Diona",
            "text": "Ah!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740812"
            ]
          },
          "700740812": {
            "id": "700740812",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Diona? What are you doing here? And why were you hiding...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740813"
            ]
          },
          "700740813": {
            "id": "700740813",
            "speakerId": 502,
            "speakerName": "Diona",
            "text": "I... I'm only here to pick some fruit, I swear! Just didn't expect I'd run into that piece of work all the way out here...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740814"
            ]
          },
          "700740814": {
            "id": "700740814",
            "speakerId": 502,
            "speakerName": "Diona",
            "text": "Ugh, he's been bugging me non-stop lately, trying to talk me into making him some drink again. I got so sick of it that I've been avoiding him whenever I can...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740815"
            ]
          },
          "700740815": {
            "id": "700740815",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "What's the story behind this drink, then?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740816"
            ]
          },
          "700740816": {
            "id": "700740816",
            "speakerId": 502,
            "speakerName": "Diona",
            "text": "So, you know how he returned recently with some of the expeditionary force, right? Well, guess what? Practically the first thing he did was swing by The Cat's Tail for a celebratory \"drink or two\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740817"
            ]
          },
          "700740817": {
            "id": "700740817",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seriously? Paimon thought they'd have just stayed back at the Knights of Favonius headquarters...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740818"
            ]
          },
          "700740818": {
            "id": "700740818",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Always had Varka down as more of an Angel's Share kinda guy myself...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740819"
            ]
          },
          "700740819": {
            "id": "700740819",
            "speakerId": 502,
            "speakerName": "Diona",
            "text": "Ugh... Hence why I said \"practically.\" They did all that, and more! The Cat's Tail was round three of a citywide tavern crawl...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740820"
            ]
          },
          "700740820": {
            "id": "700740820",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...And Paimon bets they'll do it all over again the next time another batch of troops returns home.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740821"
            ]
          },
          "700740821": {
            "id": "700740821",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "No doubt about that.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740822"
            ]
          },
          "700740822": {
            "id": "700740822",
            "speakerId": 502,
            "speakerName": "Diona",
            "text": "Anyhoo, long story short, I couldn't bear the sight of those drunk old skunks for even one second longer! So I made it my mission to mix 'em the most disgusting, nauseating drinks in all of Teyvat..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7007409",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Dadaupa Gorge",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "700740901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "700740901": {
            "id": "700740901",
            "speakerId": 1565,
            "speakerName": "Ella Musk",
            "text": "Unbelievable... Since when were hilichurls so amenable to reason?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740902"
            ]
          },
          "700740902": {
            "id": "700740902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ella! You haven't seen Varka around here, have you!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740903"
            ]
          },
          "700740903": {
            "id": "700740903",
            "speakerId": 1565,
            "speakerName": "Ella Musk",
            "text": "As a matter of fact, yes I have. Just now, he went off to borrow a \"large cauldron\" from the hilichurls... and get this — they gave it up as soon as they saw him!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740904"
            ]
          },
          "700740904": {
            "id": "700740904",
            "speakerId": 1565,
            "speakerName": "Ella Musk",
            "text": "The weirdest thing was, they barely exchanged any words at all. I just don't understand how it all went so smoothly... Could the Grand Master know some hilichurl body language that I'm unaware of?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740907"
            ]
          },
          "700740907": {
            "id": "700740907",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, that's not the point here! Anyway, where is he now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740908"
            ]
          },
          "700740908": {
            "id": "700740908",
            "speakerId": 1565,
            "speakerName": "Ella Musk",
            "text": "Right over there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740909"
            ]
          },
          "700740909": {
            "id": "700740909",
            "speakerId": 1310,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Finally, it's done! The finest wine in all of Teyvat... Right here, in my hands!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740910"
            ]
          },
          "700740910": {
            "id": "700740910",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Varka! Don't—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740911"
            ]
          },
          "700740911": {
            "id": "700740911",
            "speakerId": 1310,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Oh, hey gang — you finally made it! Those hilichurls just now were surprisingly reasonable... Didn't expect this to go half so smoothly, hah.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740912"
            ]
          },
          "700740912": {
            "id": "700740912",
            "speakerId": 1310,
            "speakerName": "Varka",
            "text": "Anyway, time to find out what this bad boy tastes like!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "700740913"
            ]
          },
          "700740913": {
            "id": "700740913",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
